provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p017:m0134","start":134,"end":137,"surface":"崔恭祖","kind":"person","person_id":"jdk_9jk_otv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p017:m0210","start":210,"end":212,"surface":"恭祖","kind":"person","person_id":"jdk_9jk_otv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p017:m0242","start":242,"end":244,"surface":"慧景","kind":"person","person_id":"tvq_7my_nqh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p017:m0257","start":257,"end":259,"surface":"慧景","kind":"person","person_id":"tvq_7my_nqh","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-051","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete-ws1504716"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p018","text":"　　臺遣中領軍王瑩都督衆軍，據湖頭築壘，上帶蔣山西巖，實甲數萬。慧景至查硎，竹塘人萬副兒善射獵，能捕虎，投慧景曰：「今平路皆爲臺軍所斷，不可議進。唯宜從蔣山龍尾上，出其不意耳。」慧景從之，分遣千餘人魚貫緣山，自西巖夜下，鼓呌臨城中。臺軍驚恐，卽時奔散。帝又遣右衞將軍左興盛率臺內三萬人，拒慧景於北籬門，望風退走。慧景引軍入樂遊苑，恭祖率輕騎十餘匹突進北掖門，乃復出，宮門皆閉。慧景引衆圍之。於是東府、石頭、白下、新亭諸城皆潰。左興盛走，不得入宮，逃淮渚荻舫中，慧景擒殺之。宮中遣兵出盪，不剋。慧景燒蘭臺府署爲戰場，守衞尉蕭暢屯南掖門處分城內，隨方應擊，衆心以此稍安。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":46,"last_line":46,"raw_start":3636,"raw_end":3919,"raw_character_offsets":[3636,3637,3638,3639,3640,3641,3642,3643,3644,3645,3646,3647,3648,3649,3650,3651,3652,3653,3654,3655,3656,3657,3658,3659,3660,3661,3662,3663,3664,3665,3666,3667,3668,3669,3670,3671,3672,3673,3674,3675,3676,3677,3678,3679,3680,3681,3682,3683,3684,3685,3686,3687,3688,3689,3690,3691,3692,3693,3694,3695,3696,3697,3698,3699,3700,3701,3702,3703,3704,3705,3706,3707,3708,3709,3710,3711,3712,3713,3714,3715,3716,3717,3718,3719,3720,3721,3722,3723,3724,3725,3726,3727,3728,3729,3730,3731,3732,3733,3734,3735,3736,3737,3738,3739,3740,3741,3742,3743,3744,3745,3746,3747,3748,3749,3750,3751,3752,3753,3754,3755,3756,3757,3758,3759,